


   =====( TrionHotkeys V1.00 )=======================================


        The Trion Hotkey Commodity.

        (c) Copyright Paul Spijkerman, '95-'97. All rights reserved.

        Written for use with the Trion BBS package.


   ===================================================================



   This is al little Utility which installs a commodity with hotkeys.

   With the hotkeys you can 'DeIconize' or 'ScreenToFront' nodes 0 and 1.
   Also you can start the Mail processor with it.


   The default hotkeys are 'right-Amiga-F1' and 'right-Amiga-F2'.
   But you can define other keys with:

   run trionhotkeys "HOTKEY0=rawkey rcommand f1" "HOTKEY1=rawkey rcommand f2" 

   (look in the Trion:startup script for an example)

   Also there is a hotkey to start the mail processor, actually what gets
   started is de 'trion:scripts/mail' script.
   The default hotkey is rigth-amiga-esc but with "MAIL=rawkey rcommand m"
   you can change it.

   To install place the line 'run TrionHotkeys' in your startup-script
   or type 'run TrionHotkeys' in a shell.

   You can deActivate the programm by starting it up a second time.


